{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415480","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415480","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1041548001:1":{"text":"やあ、可愛らしいお二人さん。実に華やかで優雅なデュエットダンスだ。喜びの場に相応しい。","source_cn":"噢，两位可爱的小朋友。你们的双人舞真是华丽优雅，与这欢...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6B39F6B565613C62","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041548002:1":{"text":"この人、何を言ってるの？","source_cn":"他在说什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x62F2AB388EE0F19F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041548003:1":{"text":"可愛らしい？","source_cn":"可爱？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x069E05816BB57DC1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041548004:1":{"text":"前も言われたよね。","source_cn":"不是第一次听到。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x82FC53182E788158","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041548005:1":{"text":"この人が言いそうな言葉だね。","source_cn":"是他的话也不奇怪。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8A6928B8859B1A9B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041548006:1":{"text":"我ともっと華やかな宴会を開いてみないか？君たちには、より大きなステージが相応しい！","source_cn":"要不要一起举办一个更华丽的宴会，你们需要一个更大的舞台！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFC7C365F6BA67022","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041548007:1":{"text":"けっこうです。","source_cn":"我们不需要。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD02D73C76D68BB36","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041548008:1":{"text":"まあそう言わずに、一杯どうだね？君たちはドレアルのように我をしらけさせたりはしないだろう？","source_cn":"来喝一杯吧，相信你们不会像顿里尔那样无趣扫兴。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x999291CDFB3BE151","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041548009:1":{"text":"世俗の規律など捨ててしまえよ。そもそも、君たちは子どもではないのだからな。そうだろう？","source_cn":"打破那些俗常戒律吧，你们也不是真的小孩子，不是吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE2C88DD107BB59E4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041548010:1":{"text":"興味ないです。","source_cn":"没兴趣。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA505BA4BE5F6EC64","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041548011:1":{"text":"拍手の方がいい。","source_cn":"还是拍手有意思。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6D78E4B80C375F1A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1041548012:1":{"text":"それは君たちがまだ本物の宴の楽しさを知らないからだ。","source_cn":"那是因为你们还没有享受到盛大宴会的乐趣。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDFE0B26506024D93","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1041548013:1":{"text":"金色に輝くステージ、照明、精巧な調度品に美しいメロディー……","source_cn":"金碧辉煌的舞台、灯光，精致的餐具陈设，优美的音乐……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x760649D9603086BC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1041548014:1":{"text":"エリア、この人自分に酔ってる。","source_cn":"伊莱亚，他在自我陶醉。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x17BF58E9C4AC366F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1041548015:1":{"text":"もう行こう、ライラ。","source_cn":"我们走吧，莱拉。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB9434CCD85F2160D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:萨基塔里斯":{"text":"サジタリス","source":"萨基塔里斯","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:伊莱亚":{"text":"エリア","source":"伊莱亚","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:莱拉":{"text":"ライラ","source":"莱拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:伊莱亚和莱拉":{"text":"エリア&ライラ","source":"伊莱亚和莱拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":16,"localized_text_